{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_074310","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Chrysalis因为不载人，能进行有人兵器无法承受的超高G机动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"它发动攻击时，恐怕很难进行反击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"另外，那家伙还装备了轨道炮。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"轨道炮？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"一种不用火药，而是用电磁力发射炮弹的武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"电子武器？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不，炮弹本身是实体。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"让电流通过磁场就会产生力。这就是弗莱明左手定则。学校没学过吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不，没学过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"算了。总之轨道炮使用的是电磁力，发射前必须先给它充电。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"一旦开始充电，就马上采取规避动作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"顺便一提，只要破坏AI就能让它失去战斗力，这点和Pupa一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"伤害积累到一定程度，Chrysalis应该就会降落。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"趁那个机会进入AI Pod。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"要是磨蹭，它就会开始自我修复。记住，一降落就立刻攻击Pod的舱门。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"交给我吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}